 "title": "1N4148W: silicon epitaxial planar switching diode in SOD-123",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 05, 20/09/2016",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A single small-signal silicon diode for fast switching, housed in the two-lead SOD-123 surface-mount case and marked W1. It withstands 75 V continuous reverse voltage (100 V peak), carries 150 mA average forward current and recovers in 4 ns or less. The same diode type is also offered as 1N4148 in DO-35, LL4148 in MiniMELF and MCL4148 in MicroMELF.",
